==Finnish==

===Cardinal number===
'''viis'''

# {{colloquial|lang=fi}} [[five]]
#:''Se maksaa viis euroo.'' (It costs five euros.)

====See also====
*[[viisi]]

===Interjection===
'''viis'''

# said to ignore something
#:*Sataa. Siitä '''viis'''! Menen silti ulos.
#:**It's raining. '''I don't care'''! I'll go out anyway.
#:*'''Viis''' siitä!
#:**''Screw'' it!
# ''adverbially used only as a part of the phrase'' viis [[veisata]] (+ [[elative]]), "not to give a damn" (+ about sth):
#:*Leena '''viis''' ''veisaa'' [[pomo]]nsa [[määräys|määräyksistä]].
#:**Leena ''doesn't give a damn''/''hoot''/''shit'' about her boss's orders.

